{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753970/extras/77fec824b4de35df9756deb7e54ea7d4.avif?t=1770917329\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Tribute Games and Dotemu are teaming up again, in collaboration with Marvel Games, to craft an original, fresh beat 'em up. Featuring dynamic combat combos and dazzling pixel art, this planet-hopping adventure stands as a love letter to the Marvel Universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753970/extras/17222880e6d5a7ba11df39bd0693b985.avif?t=1770917329\" width=616 height=118 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">So swears Annihilus, the living death that walks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">After an unprecedented attack is launched across the galaxy, all life hangs in the balance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">From New York City to the depths of the Negative Zone, the future of the Universe will be fought for across the stars in <i>MARVEL Cosmic Invasion</i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753970/extras/d39305a467c00b8316c2e616e8054a30.poster.avif?t=1770917329\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753970/extras/d39305a467c00b8316c2e616e8054a30.webm?t=1770917329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753970/extras/d39305a467c00b8316c2e616e8054a30.mp4?t=1770917329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753970/extras/75e6f0e0e29d338e5be06848309cab6e.avif?t=1770917329\" width=616 height=84 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Spider-Man, Wolverine, She-Hulk, Captain America, Phoenix, Black Panther, Storm and Iron Man, some of the most powerful earth-born Marvel Super Heroes, are ready to face the threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">But they won't be alone! Galactic Super Heroes Rocket Raccoon, Beta Ray Bill, Venom, Cosmic Ghost Rider, Nova, Phyla-Vell and the Silver Surfer enter the battle as well to complete the relentless line-up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">All will join forces in a star-spanning brawling adventure against the deadly Annihilation Wave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Whether you\u2019re an old-school expert or a first-time fan, you\u2019ll find familiar faces and discover new favorites in a captivating roster of characters from across the Marvel Universe!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753970/extras/bec90f4eb9a49669287b92f9df413ba1.poster.avif?t=1770917329\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753970/extras/bec90f4eb9a49669287b92f9df413ba1.webm?t=1770917329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753970/extras/bec90f4eb9a49669287b92f9df413ba1.mp4?t=1770917329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753970/extras/c97d63111227f9ab5319362fad7d1086.avif?t=1770917329\" width=616 height=118 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">With the Cosmic Swap tag-team system, choose two Super Heroes for each level and switch between them instantly. Create unique combos and powerful special attacks. Each character\u2019s abilities encourage creative team-ups and a more tactical approach to the action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753970/extras/699bd7bbc4291e8dbd7c781c32ab33af.poster.avif?t=1770917329\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753970/extras/699bd7bbc4291e8dbd7c781c32ab33af.webm?t=1770917329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753970/extras/699bd7bbc4291e8dbd7c781c32ab33af.mp4?t=1770917329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753970/extras/e0d78deb2c448d51675d8ce957dd5fe3.avif?t=1770917329\" width=616 height=118 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>MARVEL Cosmic Invasion</i> is a tribute to one of Marvel\u2019s most iconic eras, with stunning full-color pixel art designs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753970/extras/08ec7bdd69d799719d09a5a6be6cc4b9.poster.avif?t=1770917329\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753970/extras/08ec7bdd69d799719d09a5a6be6cc4b9.webm?t=1770917329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753970/extras/08ec7bdd69d799719d09a5a6be6cc4b9.mp4?t=1770917329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753970/extras/b51a8b16f527367854a94de9a1c45170.avif?t=1770917329\" width=616 height=118 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Whether you're teaming up with friends or family, <i>MARVEL Cosmic Invasion</i> has you covered with local/online play and a drop-in/drop-out adaptive system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A cosmic battle awaits!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753970/extras/f8e21f0b5aa34c65b554a54d6638e143.poster.avif?t=1770917329\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753970/extras/f8e21f0b5aa34c65b554a54d6638e143.webm?t=1770917329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753970/extras/f8e21f0b5aa34c65b554a54d6638e143.mp4?t=1770917329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Battle Begins!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2753970/8a3d8a36aaa6194ae861410406c5a0c9878b01b3.jpg"},{"name":"Dark Phoenix No More!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2753970/19fdfe0eda56fc4b6d08360b52c1de88a94362c3.jpg"},{"name":"Clearing out Cobwebs!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2753970/264a6f7869f41b14d8be95973f9f798de351c33c.jpg"},{"name":"Mindcontrol Meltdown!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2753970/ed189be029b2b6969ab1e8af00a61ab9d085c244.jpg"},{"name":"Mad Titan Thwarted!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2753970/13b36a82cd691d7bf5ef52b4e57de8bebd22ec97.jpg"},{"name":"Cosmic Rescue!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2753970/196361b40fe966a3f54f6fe52f19a5b9565b7f82.jpg"},{"name":"Bug Repelled!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2753970/52bf42ad0067b12927c8b4ca2778b01724f8c325.jpg"},{"name":"Matrix Maven!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2753970/28f2fb8ecc613b94d77bbb7aa696d43924ce69fc.jpg"},{"name":"Ultimate Alliance!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2753970/41af88a4db992850cc57bc8c375606b9fa7c5955.jpg"},{"name":"Maxed out Superhero!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2753970/4001534717af484129b250128aa5bd4c18b4652e.jpg"}],"total":35},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2753970?t=1770917329",